2.1.1 - 9/3/2026
- Improved target variables evaluation
- Tools packages now support revision including '/'
- Reviewed shell completions
- Improve locks API mechanisms
- Claude skills

2.1.0 - 8/31/2026
- System, user, and project level config files
- Compilation settings are now read from the target file only
- Locks are now released when the process holding them is gone
- Avoid masking builtin 'set' with conflicting target function
- Export API wrappers

2.0.2 - 6/2/2026
- Shell plugin: add project name in prompt
- Improved tables columns display
- Resolve 'goto <pkg>' stdout conflicts
- If project profile is an empty Git repo (no commits yet), read branch from symbolic ref

2.0.1 - 5/6/2026
- Fix host commands pipes and output file paths
- Handle direct calls and nested 'bash -c' calls for BuildBox API
- Allocate a TTY only when stdin is a terminal for container shell
- Fix custom registry image pull
